Third-party open-source dependencies
------------------------------------

OpenBDS uses MIT/ISC-licensed open-source packages (see package.json and
package-lock.json), notably:

  * bedrock-protocol  (MIT)  - Minecraft: Bedrock protocol library, PrismarineJS
  * jsp-raknet        (MIT)  - pure-JS RakNet implementation, PrismarineJS
  * minecraft-data    (MIT)  - protocol/data definitions, PrismarineJS
  * prismarine-nbt    (MIT)  - NBT reader/writer, PrismarineJS
  * raknet-native     (ISC)  - optional native RakNet binding (not required)

Each package ships its own license file in node_modules/.
